#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:19 d90a305ac34649cc86d9c777e821c6fc
msgid "What are Agentic Tools?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:21 607b539275ac4b9799784e348860aeea
msgid ""
"**Agentic Tools** are AI-powered tools that use Large Language Models "
"(LLMs) to perform tasks requiring human-like reasoning, analysis, and "
"creativity. Unlike traditional computational tools that follow fixed "
"algorithms, agentic tools use natural language prompts to Tutorial AI "
"models."
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:23 69ec5930f0d24af185b480ddc116958b
msgid ""
"**Perfect for**: Text analysis, research synthesis, creative writing, "
"code review, hypothesis generation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../guide/agentic_tools_tutorial.rst:25 1b78a807ce524da7aa3e7f55c7f26b8e
msgid ""
"**Not suitable for**: Mathematical calculations, API calls, file "
"processing, deterministic algorithms"
msgstr ""

